# PR Review Checklist
RULE: Verify quickmerge usage; dependency changes reflected in workspace-manifest.json; no hardcoded project IDs.
WHY: LLM-enhanced watcher checks compliance; manual review catches gaps.
CODEX: .cursor/rules/always-use-quickmerge.mdc, unified-trading-pm/workspace-manifest.json
